#. type: Title =
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Git 2.51.2 Release Notes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In addition to fixes for an unfortunate regression introduced in Git 2.51.1 "
"that caused \"git diff --quiet -w\" to be not so quiet when there are "
"additions, deletions and conflicts, this maintenance release merges more "
"fixes/improvements that have landed on the master front, primarily to make "
"the CI part of the system a bit more robust."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fixes since Git 2.51.1"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Recently we attempted to improve \"git diff -w --quiet\" and friends to "
"handle cases where patch output would be suppressed, but it introduced a bug "
"that emits unnecessary output, which has been corrected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The code to squelch output from \"git diff -w --name-status\" etc. for paths "
"that \"git diff -w -p\" would have stayed silent leaked output from dry-run "
"patch generation, which has been corrected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Windows \"real-time monitoring\" interferes with the execution of tests and "
"affects negatively in both correctness and performance, which has been "
"disabled in Gitlab CI."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:32
msgid ""
"An earlier addition to \"git diff --no-index A B\" to limit the output with "
"pathspec after the two directories misbehaved when these directories were "
"given with a trailing slash, which has been corrected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:37
msgid ""
"The \"--short\" option of \"git status\" that meant output for humans and "
"\"-z\" option to show NUL delimited output format did not mix well, and "
"colored some but not all things.  The command has been updated to color all "
"elements consistently in such a case."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:39
msgid "Unicode width table update."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Recent OpenSSH creates the Unix domain socket to communicate with ssh-agent "
"under $HOME instead of /tmp, which causes our test to fail doe to overly "
"long pathname in our test environment, which has been worked around by using "
"\"ssh-agent -T\"."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/RelNotes/2.51.2.adoc:45
msgid "Also contains various documentation updates, code cleanups and minor fixups."
msgstr ""
